text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_08171C8F {
    "Okay!\nWe’re to move out to MT. PYRE!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_08171CB4 {
    "Ahead looms MT. PYRE...\pIt is a natural monument to the spirits \nof departed POKéMON..."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_08171D0C {
    "MT. PYRE PIER\p...The sign is old and worn out.\nThe words are barely legible..."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_08171D5B {
    "“Filled with rare POKéMON!”\nSAFARI ZONE"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BF96E {
    "Will you play with my delightfully\npretty POKéMON?"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BF9A1 {
    "This isn’t what I meant!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BF9BA {
    "I’m going to a CONTEST in LILYCOVE.\pMy POKéMON should have no problem\nsweeping the MASTER CLASS."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFA1B {
    "With my POKéMON, I have traveled the\nworld’s four corners.\pYou might say I have some confidence\nin my abilities."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFA8C {
    "Ah, well played."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFA9D {
    "I would like to circle the globe once\nagain with my POKéMON."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFADA {
    "With my POKéMON, I have traveled the\nworld’s four corners.\pYou might say I have some confidence\nin my abilities."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFB4B {
    "Ah, well played."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFB5C {
    "Your POKéMON and you...\pYour prowess together will be\nconsidered strong, even overseas."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFBB4 {
    "There are powers beyond our\nunderstanding in the world..."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFBEE {
    "I have lost..."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFBFD {
    "MT. PYRE...\nThere is a mysterious power\lat work there..."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFC36 {
    "KATE: Together, we’re fearless!\nWe’ll demonstrate how tough we are!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFC7A {
    "KATE: I blew it in front of my junior\nstudent partner..."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFCB3 {
    "KATE: When someone’s relying on me,\nI get this urge to look cool in front\lof them..."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFD08 {
    "KATE: If you’ve only got one POKéMON,\nwe can’t battle with you.\pThat would be bullying."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFD60 {
    "JOY: Together, we’re fearless!\nWe’ll demonstrate how tough we are!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFDA3 {
    "JOY: Please forgive me, KATE!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFDC1 {
    "JOY: Ehehe, I’ll have to train with KATE,\nmy senior student partner, again."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFE0D {
    "JOY: You need at least two POKéMON\nif you’re going to challenge us!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFE51 {
    "Stop! Have a good look at my precious\nPOKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFE80 {
    "Oh, how dare you!\nDon’t take it so seriously!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFEAE {
    "Maybe I’ll go catch more POKéMON at\nthe SAFARI."
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFEDE {
    "My precious POKéMON grew!\nHave a good look!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFF0A {
    "Oh, how dare you!\nYou still won’t take it easy!"
}

text Naranja_Route121_G00_M36_Text_081BFF3A {
    "Maybe I’ll go catch more POKéMON at\nthe SAFARI."
}
